                                            {
                                                "example_id": "600f8ef8-fb89-4866-9031-51b2edb6d3ed",
                                                "sense_id": "57c2fd97-0cea-3919-8200-6b7e54e9dbd6",
                                                "text": "PP’s enthusiasts claim that it emboldens nervous speakers and forces everyone to present information in an ordered way. […] The presentational precursor to PowerPoint was the overhead projector, which is why PP screens are still called “slides”."
